  UMAFall
      E. Casilari, J. A. Santoyo-Ramon, J. M. Cano-Garcia, "UMAFall: A Multisensor Dataset for
      the Research on Automatic Fall Detection", Procedia Computer Science 110, 2017.
      Universidad de Malaga. CC BY 4.0. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.4214283
      A few short recordings from it are also bundled as test and demonstration samples.

  WEDA-FALL
      J. Marques, P. Moreno, "Online Fall Detection Using Wrist Devices", Sensors 23(3), 2023.
      https://github.com/joaojtmarques/WEDA-FALL
      Used for training and testing only. Its repository states no licence, so no recording
      from it is redistributed here.

